  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Mylodon darwinii has a long narrow head, low shaggy body and strong curved foreclaws. Whole-body proportions, fur distribution and colour are estimates; claw shape alone does not establish digging or burrowing behaviour.",
    "zh": "达尔文磨齿兽 Mylodon darwinii 具有狭长头部、低矮蓬毛身体和强壮弯曲的前爪。全身比例、毛长分布及颜色为估计；爪形本身不能证明挖掘或掘洞行为。"
